{"seq":2,"slug":"representment-template-network","title":"举证模板与网络门户/API 提交","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/chargeback-dispute-representment/evidence-representment/representment-template-network","wordCount":1574,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"举证模板与网络门户-api-提交\">举证模板与网络门户/API 提交</h1><p>证据组装完成只走完一半。发卡行不接受「你自己的格式」，它只接受按网络规范提交的结构化材料，且必须在时限内通过正确的通道送达。这一步的失败模式很集中：字段对不上、文件超限、提交成功但状态没同步、以及最危险的——<strong>你以为提交了，回执却没有</strong>。这一篇讲怎么把证据映射到网络要求的结构，并通过门户或 API 可靠地送达。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两条提交通道\">核心概念：两条提交通道</h2><p>收单侧通常有两条路径把举证送到网络：<strong>门户（portal）手工提交</strong>与<strong>API/文件批量提交</strong>。二者的工程定位不同，成熟平台一般是 API 为主、门户为兜底。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>门户</th>\n<th>API / 批量文件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>吞吐量</td>\n<td>低，人工作业</td>\n<td>高，可自动化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单案处理时长</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误发现</td>\n<td>即时（表单校验）</td>\n<td>事后（回执或对账）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适配规则变更</td>\n<td>页面更新即生效</td>\n<td>需跟随接口版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>复杂个案、兜底、争议升级</td>\n<td>日常批量案件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践建议：<strong>API 处理占比高的案件（判定规则明确、证据模板化），门户留给需要人工判断的个案</strong>。这个分配不是技术偏好，而是成本结构决定的——人工提交一单的时间成本远高于 API，而复杂个案本来就需要人。Visa 侧对应的是争议管理 API 与 VROL 类门户，Mastercard 侧对应 Mastercom 门户与其批量接口；具体接口名与版本随网络文档更新，接入前必须以收单行提供的最新规范为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"证据到网络字段的映射\">证据到网络字段的映射</h2><p>网络要求的材料是<strong>固定字段 + 附件</strong>的组合。固定字段用于结构化判定，附件（图片、PDF、日志）作为佐证。映射层的工作是把你的证据单元翻译成这组字段。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;case_id&quot;: &quot;NET-CB-2026-09-4432&quot;,&#10;  &quot;submission&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;stage&quot;: &quot;representment&quot;,&#10;    &quot;reason_code&quot;: &quot;13.1&quot;,&#10;    &quot;response_payload&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;merchant_name&quot;: &quot;…&quot;,&#10;      &quot;transaction_identifier&quot;: &quot;TX20260915A0C7B1&quot;,&#10;      &quot;clearing_date&quot;: &quot;2026-09-16&quot;,&#10;      &quot;amount&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: 4899, &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;USD&quot; },&#10;      &quot;response_code&quot;: &quot;GOODS_SERVICES_PROVIDED&quot;,&#10;      &quot;narrative&quot;: &quot;Order delivered to billing address on 2026-09-12; signed.&quot;,&#10;      &quot;documentation&quot;: [&#10;        { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;PROOF_OF_DELIVERY&quot;, &quot;file&quot;: &quot;pod_4432.pdf&quot;, &quot;sha256&quot;: &quot;b1c9…&quot; },&#10;        { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;ORDER_RECEIPT&quot;, &quot;file&quot;: &quot;order_4432.pdf&quot;, &quot;sha256&quot;: &quot;77ad…&quot; }&#10;      ]&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"case_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NET-CB-2026-09-4432\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"submission\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"stage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"representment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"reason_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"13.1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"response_payload\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"merchant_name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"…\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"transaction_identifier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"TX20260915A0C7B1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"clearing_date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-16\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4899</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"response_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GOODS_SERVICES_PROVIDED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"narrative\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Order delivered to billing address on 2026-09-12; signed.\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"documentation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PROOF_OF_DELIVERY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"file\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pod_4432.pdf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"sha256\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"b1c9…\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ORDER_RECEIPT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"file\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order_4432.pdf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"sha256\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"77ad…\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个设计要点。<strong><code>response_code</code> 是受控词表，不是自由文本</strong>——它把「你主张什么」压成一个网络可判定的枚举值，选错会直接导致不受理。<strong><code>narrative</code> 有长度限制且不参与实质判定</strong>，它的作用是给专员一句话的上下文，所以不要把它写成小作文。<strong>附件要带哈希</strong>：这是你在后续升级阶段证明「材料未被替换」的唯一依据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE representment_submission (&#10;  id               BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  dispute_case_id  BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  evidence_unit_id VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  channel          VARCHAR(12) NOT NULL,       -- api | portal&#10;  network          VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,&#10;  stage            VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  response_code    VARCHAR(48) NOT NULL,&#10;  payload          JSON        NOT NULL,&#10;  submitted_at     DATETIME(3),&#10;  receipt_id       VARCHAR(64),&#10;  receipt_status   VARCHAR(24),                -- accepted | rejected | pending&#10;  reject_reason    VARCHAR(128),&#10;  UNIQUE KEY uk_case_stage_channel (dispute_case_id, stage, channel)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> representment_submission</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id               </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dispute_case_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_unit_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- api | portal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  network          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  stage            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  response_code    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">48</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  payload          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  submitted_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  receipt_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  receipt_status   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),                </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- accepted | rejected | pending</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reject_reason    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uk_case_stage_channel (dispute_case_id, stage, channel)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>receipt_status</code> 与 <code>reject_reason</code> 是这张表存在的理由：<strong>提交动作与受理结果必须分开存</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"提交回执与状态同步\">提交回执与状态同步</h2><p>最危险的失败不是提交被拒，而是<strong>提交状态未知</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"幂等提交与回执对账\">幂等提交与回执对账</h3><p>网络接口在超时、连接重置、限流时会返回不确定结果：请求可能已经落地，也可能没有。此时任何重试都要面对同一个问题——重复提交会不会造成两份材料？</p>\n<p>标准做法是<strong>幂等键 + 回执对账</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"submit(case, stage, unit):&#10;  idem_key = f&quot;{case.id}:{stage}:{unit.sha256}&quot;&#10;  existing = submission_repo.find_by(idem_key)&#10;  if existing and existing.receipt_status == &#39;accepted&#39;:&#10;      return existing                     # 已受理，直接返回，不重提&#10;&#10;  resp = network_client.post(payload, idempotency_key=idem_key, timeout=30s)&#10;&#10;  if resp is timeout or connection_error:&#10;      return status = UNKNOWN             # 绝不盲目重试&#10;  if resp.status &gt;= 400:&#10;      return status = REJECTED, reason = resp.body.code&#10;  submission_repo.save(receipt_id=resp.receipt_id, receipt_status=&#39;pending&#39;)&#10;  return status = PENDING\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>submit(case, stage, unit):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  idem_key = f\"{case.id}:{stage}:{unit.sha256}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  existing = submission_repo.find_by(idem_key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if existing and existing.receipt_status == 'accepted':</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return existing                     # 已受理，直接返回，不重提</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  resp = network_client.post(payload, idempotency_key=idem_key, timeout=30s)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if resp is timeout or connection_error:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return status = UNKNOWN             # 绝不盲目重试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if resp.status >= 400:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return status = REJECTED, reason = resp.body.code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  submission_repo.save(receipt_id=resp.receipt_id, receipt_status='pending')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return status = PENDING</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>UNKNOWN</code> 必须是一个<strong>显式状态</strong>，并且必须由对账任务收敛：定期拉取该案件在该阶段的受理记录，若网络侧已有对应材料则把本地状态修正为 <code>ACCEPTED</code>，否则才是真正的未提交、可以安全重试。把 <code>UNKNOWN</code> 当成失败去重试，会在网络侧产生重复材料；把它当成成功而不管，会在时限走完后才发现根本没提交。<strong>两种处理都错，只有对账是对的</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"拒绝原因的分类处理\">拒绝原因的分类处理</h3><p><code>REJECTED</code> 不等于败诉，它只是<strong>材料不合规</strong>，通常可以修正后重提（前提是还在时限内）。常见拒绝原因与处理：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>拒绝码类别</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>格式/字段类</td>\n<td>必填字段缺失、枚举值非法</td>\n<td>立即修正重提</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>附件类</td>\n<td>类型不支持、大小超限、不可读</td>\n<td>转换/压缩后重提</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阶段/时限类</td>\n<td>该阶段不允许该动作、已超时</td>\n<td>不可重提，转升级或认赔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复提交类</td>\n<td>该案件该阶段已有材料</td>\n<td>转为查询已有材料状态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二类需要提前设防：网络对附件通常有<strong>单文件大小上限与允许的类型集合</strong>，在组装阶段就应该按上限裁剪（例如妥投截图压缩到可读的最小分辨率），而不是等到被拒。第三类则说明<strong>提交前置校验不足</strong>——如果没有在本地就校验「当前阶段允许哪些动作」，你会用一次真实的拒绝换取这个常识，而这次拒绝可能就是时限的最后一次机会。</p>\n<h2 id=\"提交前的本地校验\">提交前的本地校验</h2><p>把关口前移到本地，是唯一能规模化降低拒绝率的办法。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与时限模型联动\">与时限模型联动</h3><p>校验清单应当与网络规范同步维护，并作为提交函数的硬前置：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>校验</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>阶段-动作合法性</td>\n<td>当前争议阶段是否允许 <code>response_code</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时限剩余 &gt; 阈值</td>\n<td>避免提交到一半超时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>附件类型与大小</td>\n<td>避免附件类拒绝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>受控词表命中</td>\n<td>避免自由文本被拒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证据单元状态</td>\n<td><code>BLOCKED</code> 状态禁止提交</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这里必须与 <a href=\"../chargeback-lifecycle/dispute-stage-deadline\">争议阶段与响应时限</a> 的时钟模型联动：<strong>提交前重新读一次 <code>due_at</code></strong>，而不是信任组装时的快照。若剩余时间不足以完成一次提交加可能的修正重提，应当走兜底策略（最小可用证据包或主动认赔），而不是提交一份大概率被拒的材料。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>两条通道分工：API 处理模板化案件，门户留给需要人工判断的个案。</li>\n<li>映射层的核心是 <code>response_code</code> 受控词表与附件哈希，narrative 只是辅助上下文。</li>\n<li>提交动作与受理结果分开存储；<code>UNKNOWN</code> 必须是显式状态并由对账收敛。</li>\n<li>幂等键用「案件 + 阶段 + 证据哈希」构造，重复提交被吸收而非产生重复材料。</li>\n<li>拒绝原因分类处理：格式/附件可重提，阶段/时限类不可重提。</li>\n<li>本地前置校验（阶段-动作合法性、时限、附件限制）是降低拒绝率的主要手段。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[证据单元 READY] --&gt; B[本地前置校验]&#10;  B --&gt;|不通过| C[修正或转兜底]&#10;  B --&gt;|通过| D{幂等键已受理?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[返回既有回执]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[调用网络提交接口]&#10;  F --&gt;|超时/连接错误| G[状态 UNKNOWN]&#10;  F --&gt;|4xx| H[REJECTED + 分类处理]&#10;  F --&gt;|受理| I[PENDING + 存回执 ID]&#10;  G --&gt; J[对账任务收敛状态]&#10;  J --&gt;|网络侧有材料| K[修正为 ACCEPTED]&#10;  J --&gt;|网络侧无材料| L[安全重试]\">graph TD\n  A[证据单元 READY] --&gt; B[本地前置校验]\n  B --&gt;|不通过| C[修正或转兜底]\n  B --&gt;|通过| D{幂等键已受理?}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[返回既有回执]\n  D --&gt;|否| F[调用网络提交接口]\n  F --&gt;|超时/连接错误| G[状态 UNKNOWN]\n  F --&gt;|4xx| H[REJECTED + 分类处理]\n  F --&gt;|受理| I[PENDING + 存回执 ID]\n  G --&gt; J[对账任务收敛状态]\n  J --&gt;|网络侧有材料| K[修正为 ACCEPTED]\n  J --&gt;|网络侧无材料| L[安全重试]</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"举证模板与网络门户/API 提交","id":"举证模板与网络门户-api-提交"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两条提交通道","id":"核心概念-两条提交通道"},{"level":2,"text":"证据到网络字段的映射","id":"证据到网络字段的映射"},{"level":2,"text":"提交回执与状态同步","id":"提交回执与状态同步"},{"level":3,"text":"幂等提交与回执对账","id":"幂等提交与回执对账"},{"level":3,"text":"拒绝原因的分类处理","id":"拒绝原因的分类处理"},{"level":2,"text":"提交前的本地校验","id":"提交前的本地校验"},{"level":3,"text":"与时限模型联动","id":"与时限模型联动"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"举证包自动组装","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/chargeback-dispute-representment/evidence-representment/evidence-package-assembly"},"next":{"title":"Pre-arbitration 与仲裁阶段","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/chargeback-dispute-representment/evidence-representment/arbitration-pre-arbitration"}}